  "npc_response": "This hold? It's where the ring's secrets go to die. Crates get magnetically clamped, shipments get signed, and nobody ever looks inside twice. The mech in the corner — that's the one thing that doesn't move on its own. It's been here since the first shipment, and it's never once complained. I like it. It doesn't ask questions. It just works. Want to know what it's been hauling? Name a price."
}

