  "npc_response": "I am the man who keeps the garrison's arrows true. I have spent my days here, in this little shed, felling wood, stretching strings, and fitting feathers to shafts until the bow sings. I do not seek praise, and I do not ask for much — but I ask that those who rely on my arrows remember my name when they stand between the enemy and their homes."
