  "npc_response": "Longer than the reeds remember, wanderer. The swamp does not count years the way your world does. I have watched the same fire burn, the same spit turn, the same coconuts gather. Some days I forget my own name. Others, I remember the fever man who came with Leopold's shadow, and I wonder if he ever found his way back. But the hut has been here, and the fire has burned, and that is all the time I need."
